    "category": "rule",
    "excerpt": "This bot is the classic crossing of the 20 EMA above the 50 EMA while the RSI is below 70 (oversold). \u2026 I tested it on 1H and 15m and it works very well in the backtests with ETH and other currencies. \u2026 the RR is 2:1 and it also has a Move SL as protection along with the reverse crossover of the EMAs as more protection. \u2026 The Winrate seems a bit marginal but we will see how the live test develops.",
    "performance_claim": "it works very well in the backtests with ETH",
    "verbatim_confidence": "high",
    "notes": "EMA 20/50 cross + RSI<70 filter, 2:1 RR, exit on reverse cross; author mislabels RSI<70 as oversold; stop distance unstated. Use 1h (15m variant excluded)."
  },
